    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "741f8977dff1a49369fd": "Stop giving me that look. I may not be an adventurer like you, but that doesn't mean I can't have a few muscles. All that stirring makes your arms strong.",
        "79d307334eafee62b787": "There's nothing more I can teach you. I've heard of a night elf who might be able to, though. Her name is Ainethil, and she lives in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
        "7a2234f1f4460ba3652f": "I'm sorry, $n, but I have no time to spend on novices. You want someone closer to your own skill level. Try the night elf Milla Fairancora, in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus.",
        "a2f67560d77beefec691": "You want my help? You got it. What do you need?",
        "f9b6f104c544f6851401": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Alchemist Narett",
      "subName": "Expert Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
